input operation appendCStringToDestinationBuffer destinationBuffer COpaqueMemoryAddress
input operation appendCStringToDestinationBuffer sourceBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString
output operation appendCStringToDestinationBuffer CByteCount
useCapability appendCStringToDestinationBuffer memoryBufferReadCapability
