argument catTotalCall left I64 destEnd
argument catTotalCall right I64 catSrcIdx
run catTotalCall
bind value catTotal CByteCount catTotalCall
return value catTotal

# ---- copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer(dest, src, n) -> bytes written ----
# Copy at most n bytes from src to dest. If src is shorter than n, pad
# with NUL up to n bytes (matching C copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer semantics). Does NOT
# guarantee NUL-termination if stringByteLength(src) >= n.
operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer
input operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer destinationBuffer COpaqueMemoryAddress
input operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer sourceBuffer CNullTerminatedByteString
input operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer maxByteCount CByteCount
output operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer CByteCount
useCapability copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer memoryBufferReadCapability
effect copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer read memory.buffer
useCapability copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer memoryBufferWriteCapability
effect copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer write memory.buffer
memory copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer heap no
memory copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer stack max 1024
async copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer no
purpose operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer "Pure-SemanticScript copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer. Up to n bytes copied from src to dest; remainder NUL-padded. Returns n."
invariant operation copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer "Copies up to byteCount bytes from source; pads with NUL bytes if source is shorter; matches strncpy semantics."

label startCopyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer
storage module immutable zeroNcp I64 0
storage module immutable oneNcp I64 1
memory copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer mutable ncpIdx I64 0
memory copyCStringPrefixToDestinationBuffer mutable ncpReachedNul I64 0
label ncpLoop
call ncpDoneCall math.greaterThanOrEqualI64
argument ncpDoneCall left I64 ncpIdx
argument ncpDoneCall right I64 maxByteCount
